  },
  "section": "3.274",
  "rulesText": "Cost: 1 Sorcery Point\n\nWhen you cast a spell, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to cast it without any Verbal, Somatic, or Material components, except Material components that are consumed by the spell or that have a cost specified in the spell."
}
